flowchart TB
    App[Application: vLLM / SGLang]
    Client[Pod A: Client / RealClient]

    subgraph Control [Control plane]
        Master[MasterService]
    end

    subgraph Storage [Data plane: storage backends]
        subgraph MemoryBackend [Primary: memory replica with local SSD expansion]
            Memory[MEMORY: shared DRAM replica]
            Offload[Client B / FileStorage]
            SSD[LOCAL_DISK: memory capacity extension]

            Memory -->|Offload| Offload
            Offload -->|Local I/O| SSD
            SSD -->|Read for restore| Offload
        end

        NoF[NOF_SSD: shared NVMe-oF SSD]
        DFS[DFS: shared filesystem]
        Disk[DISK: backend files]
    end

    App -->|Put / Get| Client

    Master -.->|Descriptors via MasterClient| Client
    Master -.->|Offload task replies| Offload

    Client <-->|Transfer Engine: RDMA / TCP| Memory
    Client -->|Restore RPC and TE pull| Offload

    Client <-->|SPDK: NVMe-oF| NoF
    Client <-->|DFS backend: POSIX / HF3FS| DFS
    Client <-->|File backend I/O| Disk
